  "prefLabel": "Env-A 102.24 Annual",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 102.24 “Annual” means a time period from January 1 of a calendar year through December 31 of the same year.\n\nSource. #6482-A, eff 4-1-97; renumbered by #8256 (from Env-A 101.32), (see Revision Note #1 at chapter heading); renumbered by #8304 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading); ss by #13105, eff 9-25-20 (formerly Env-A 101.25) (see Revision Note #4 at chapter heading for Env-A 100)",
